  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crab_Claws/BH_Crab_Claws_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">在2023年Minecraft大会上宣布的最重要特性之一，就是有望将蟹钳加入游戏，让玩家能够以更远的距离破坏和放置方块。遗憾的是，这个想法最终被搁置，永远不会出现在原版Minecraft中……等等，这个模组实现了它！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在玩家可以在宝箱或水域结构中找到这些蟹钳，装备后即可在8格外破坏和放置方块。你还可以进行其他交互操作！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">我们建议将蟹钳装备在副手上！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>需要服务器和好友联机吗？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crab_Claws/BH_Crab_Claws_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你想寻找服务器与好友畅玩任意模组或整合包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>是你的理想选择！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此链接</strong></a>并使用优惠码\"Lupin\"可享25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crab_Claws/BH_Crab_Claws_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在你可以使用全新蟹钳从更远距离破坏或放置方块！<br>当然，将其置于副手仍会保持相同效果。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crab_Claws/BH_Crab_Claws_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支持服务器环境吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！运行完全正常！请记住，与好友体验模组的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting服务器，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接可享25%专属折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模组可用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！但仅限发布于Modrinth或CurseForge平台。上传至其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，这是绝对不允许的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将其加入你的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包，我们将不胜感激。如需任何小调整或有疑问，欢迎联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以录制模组视频并在频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然，欢迎你在频道中体验此模组或我们的任何整合包并制作相关视频，事实上我们会非常感激！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crab_Claws/BH_Crab_Claws_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/275/crab-claws-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/276/crab-claws-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"